  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Robin Litwin</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3761 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-bank-shows category-events category-meet-the-artist category-monthly-meetings category-the-gallery category-news tag-artweekma tag-donna-julian-spillane tag-doris-mee tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-harwich-chamber-of-commerce tag-martha-little-fuentes tag-meet-the-artist tag-robin-litwin tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3761\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/may-guild-news/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" alt=\"A blank white image.\" src=\"/media/archive/756fb9062dc3b8319cf9143d170258ae733c4c39396c5a3879bbaaf72f244534.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/may-guild-news/\" rel=\"bookmark\">May Guild News</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-05-01T01:21:11-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, May 1, 2018, 1:21 am\">May 1, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>At the Guild meeting on April 21, members voted and approved of by-law changes which included: Guild membership is expanded to include residents or taxpayers of Barnstable County A “quorum” <a href=\"/news/may-guild-news/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3712 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-education category-news tag-creative-arts-center tag-family-pantry-of-cape-cod tag-hrwich-cultural-center tag-robin-litwin\" id=\"post-3712\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/guild-member-robin-litwin-offers-encaustic-instruction/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"848\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A group of people holding up their paintings in front of a table.\" src=\"/media/archive/b3414b5ff4822236a7666b5494414c7eab8e1ef25f88437948fee23f500c02de.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guild-member-robin-litwin-offers-encaustic-instruction/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild Member Robin Litwin Offers Encaustic Instruction</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-18T12:38:45-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, April 18, 2018, 12:38 pm\">April 18, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>I have been loving encaustic painting for the past five years and want to thank Mary Moquin for helping me in countless ways; she is the most generous and gifted <a href=\"/news/guild-member-robin-litwin-offers-encaustic-instruction/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3705 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-education category-events category-news tag-artweek tag-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-robin-litwin\" id=\"post-3705\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/robin-litwin-demonstrates-encaustic-painting-for-artweek/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"548\" height=\"410\" alt=\"©Robin Litwin, Bartletts on Turquoise\" src=\"/media/archive/f80ded191ea06dad5823e53a34595e7ffcc2468dfb0b265fcd12dea007e11e93.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/robin-litwin-demonstrates-encaustic-painting-for-artweek/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Robin Litwin Demonstrates Encaustic Painting for ArtWeek</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-05T20:28:18-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, April 5, 2018, 8:28 pm\">April 5, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>New member of The Guild of Harwich Artists, Robin Litwin is a Harwich artist and photographer. In 2008, she retired from a 25-year career teaching in the Art Department at <a href=\"/news/robin-litwin-demonstrates-encaustic-painting-for-artweek/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n",
